  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funguo Innovation Program and Facility: Phase I</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Funguo is designed to lay the foundation for and unlock the potential of Tanzanian innovators and entrepreneurs to create Impact Ventures at scale. The overall objective of the program is that Impact Ventures contribute to the achievement of the national development goals and the SDGs in Tanzania by supporting the creation of more Impact Ventures (with a focus on women and youth lead ventures) to scale. In particular, the program will work on (i) access to 3rd party finance for portfolio Impact Ventures, (ii) am supporting Business Development Service providers (BDS) in the Innovation Ecosystem to generate more investment ready and scalable Impact Ventures, and (iii) improving the Enabling Environment for women and youth lead innovation ventures.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
